#audit_axioms GroupApproximation.SimpleKazhdanSofic.eventually_mapMatrix_eq_one
#audit_axioms GroupApproximation.SimpleKazhdanSofic.ultraMap_one_ne_zero
#audit_axioms GroupApproximation.SimpleKazhdanSofic.eq_one_of_ultraMap_eq_one
